<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>About EngineerLaunch</title><style>:root{--blue:#1769ff;--ink:#17233c;--muted:#697890;--line:#e1e7f0;--soft:#f7f9fc}*{box-sizing:border-box}body{margin:0;background:var(--soft);color:var(--ink);font:16px/1.7 Inter,system-ui}.about-hero{padding:42px 5%;background:linear-gradient(125deg,#edf5ff,#fff);border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}.wrap{width:min(1180px,100%);margin:auto}.label{color:var(--blue);font-size:12px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase}.about-hero h1{max-width:850px;margin:8px 0;font-size:clamp(34px,5vw,52px);line-height:1.08}.about-hero p{max-width:780px;margin:0;color:var(--muted);font-size:17px}.content{padding:45px 5%}.intro{max-width:820px;margin:0 auto 30px;text-align:center}.intro h2{font-size:35px;line-height:1.2}.intro p,.card p{color:var(--muted)}.grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:16px}.card{padding:24px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:16px;background:#fff;transition:.2s}.card:hover{transform:translateY(-4px);border-color:var(--blue);box-shadow:0 15px 32px #1769ff16}.card b{display:grid;place-items:center;width:42px;height:42px;border-radius:11px;background:#eef4ff;color:var(--blue)}.card h3{margin:13px 0 5px}.contact{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:20px;margin-top:32px;padding:27px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:17px;background:#fff}.contact h2{margin:3px 0}.contact a{color:var(--blue);font-weight:700;text-decoration:none}@media(max-width:750px){.grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.contact{align-items:flex-start;flex-direction:column}}</style></head><body><section class="about-hero"><div class="wrap"><span class="label">The complete career marketplace</span><h1>Don’t search everywhere. Build your career in one place.</h1><p>EngineerLaunch brings verified job discovery, structured learning, practice and interview preparation into one connected platform.</p></div></section><main class="content"><div class="wrap"><section class="intro"><span class="label">Who we are</span><h2>More than a job portal. We are a career ecosystem.</h2><p>Opportunities, skills and preparation resources are scattered across many websites. We connect the important parts of a student’s career journey while keeping every application linked to its official source.</p></section><section class="grid"><article class="card"><b>01</b><h3>Discover</h3><p>Search current roles using company, technology, location, experience and work-mode filters.</p></article><article class="card"><b>02</b><h3>Learn</h3><p>Follow paths for Java, Spring Boot, PHP, Laravel, frontend, DSA, system design, ML and data science.</p></article><article class="card"><b>03</b><h3>Prepare and apply</h3><p>Practise interview concepts and continue to the employer’s official careers page when ready.</p></article></section><section class="contact"><div><span class="label">Contact us</span><h2>Let’s build better careers together.</h2></div><div>Email: <a href="mailto:sachinsoni77998@gmail.com">sachinsoni77998@gmail.com</a><br>Phone: <a href="tel:+916283570676">6283570676</a></div></section></div></main></body></html>
